## SuperMandi SuperAdmin dashboard (Vite)
##
## IMPORTANT:
## - Vite only loads env vars at dev-server start/build time.
##   After editing .env, restart `npm run dev`.
##
## Cloud backend base URL (public IP or domain)
## IMPORTANT: Must point to API Gateway (port 3000), NOT directly to backend services
## GO-LIVE-101: Use placeholder - actual URL goes in .env.local (not committed)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

## Admin token to access protected admin endpoints.
## Must match backend `ADMIN_TOKEN` on the VM.
## GO-LIVE-101: NEVER commit actual token - use .env.local
VITE_ADMIN_TOKEN=your_admin_token_here

